id=unfuse_zygisk
name=Unfuse Zygisk
version=v1.4
versionCode=5
author=NIK2703
description=Direct internal storage for all apps — no FUSE, no scoped storage. Exposes /data/media in each app's private mount namespace, lifts Android/data and Android/obb isolation, and adds optional SELinux execute/symlink/hardlink permissions for apps on storage.
